From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Benjamin Larsson <benjamin.larsson@genexis.eu>
Date: Fri, 18 Apr 2025 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: use GDM3 PSE port for WDMA on EN7523

On EN7523 the WDMA connects to the PSE fabric via GDM3 (port 3), not
CDM4 (port 7) as on EN7581/AN7583.  This was confirmed by the old
ECNT 5.4 SDK which defines WHNAT_WDMA_PORT = 3 and labels the
corresponding queue allocation as "/* GDM3->XFI */".

The upstream commit that introduced WLAN flowtable TX offload
(085-v6.18-net-airoha-Add-wlan-flowtable-TX-offload.patch) hard-codes
FE_PSE_PORT_CDM4 for the WDMA path because it targets EN7581.  Apply
the correct port value for EN7523 using the airoha_is() SoC check.

Two locations need fixing:

1. airoha_ppe_foe_entry_prepare: select FE_PSE_PORT_GDM3 when running
   on EN7523 so that HW-offloaded WLAN flows are steered to the right
   PSE port.

2. airoha_ppe_foe_flow_stats_update: the early-return that skips the
   stats update for WDMA flows must also trigger on FE_PSE_PORT_GDM3
   when running on EN7523.

Signed-off-by: Benjamin Larsson <benjamin.larsson@genexis.eu>
---
 drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_ppe.c | 12 ++++++------
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_ppe.c b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_ppe.c
index a1b2c3d..e4f5a6b 100644
--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_ppe.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_ppe.c
@@ -314,9 +314,11 @@ static int airoha_ppe_foe_entry_prepare(struct airoha_eth *eth,
 		struct airoha_wdma_info info = {};

 		if (!airoha_ppe_get_wdma_info(dev, data->eth.h_dest, &info)) {
-			val |= FIELD_PREP(AIROHA_FOE_IB2_NBQ, info.idx) |
-			       FIELD_PREP(AIROHA_FOE_IB2_PSE_PORT,
-					  FE_PSE_PORT_CDM4);
+			val |= FIELD_PREP(AIROHA_FOE_IB2_NBQ, info.idx) |
+			       FIELD_PREP(AIROHA_FOE_IB2_PSE_PORT,
+					  airoha_is(eth, an7523) ?
+					  FE_PSE_PORT_GDM3 :
+					  FE_PSE_PORT_CDM4);
 			qdata |= FIELD_PREP(AIROHA_FOE_ACTDP, info.bss);
 			wlan_etype = FIELD_PREP(AIROHA_FOE_MAC_WDMA_BAND,
 						info.idx) |
@@ -600,7 +602,9 @@ static void airoha_ppe_foe_flow_stats_update(struct airoha_ppe *ppe,
 	}

 	pse_port = FIELD_GET(AIROHA_FOE_IB2_PSE_PORT, *ib2);
-	if (pse_port == FE_PSE_PORT_CDM4)
+	if (pse_port == FE_PSE_PORT_CDM4 ||
+	    (airoha_is(ppe->eth, an7523) &&
+	     pse_port == FE_PSE_PORT_GDM3))
 		return;

 	airoha_ppe_foe_flow_stat_entry_reset(ppe, npu, index);
